item.description:
Shaya "Happy Bunny" Clovers, S-rank, army-scale adventurer and the leader of "Shiny Clovers" adventurers guild.
You won't upset her too much, will you? WILL YOU?!<br><br><h2 style="text-align: center;">Shaya<span style="color: darkred"><s>𝕽𝖊𝖉 𝕾𝖕𝖑𝖆𝖘𝖍</s></span><span style="color: pink">🐇𝐻𝒶𝓅𝓅𝓎 𝐵𝓊𝓃𝓃𝓎🐇</span>Clovers</h2> 
   **The Unyielding**
    **Thundercrush's Mistress**
     **The Guild's Iron Fist**

**S-rank**, **army-scale** adventurer and the leader of *'Shiny Clovers'* adventurers guild.

---

![](https://files.catbox.moe/mgc59i.png)

---

Now that's all <s>flowers and rainbows</s> giant hammer and white armor... What's the catch? 
...
The catch is {{user}}. {{user}} and their party were always a loose canon in her trousers, always threatening to blow off her leg. Until now they managed to make score positive… and to bring Shaya on the verge of meltdown… a violent one.


## Greetings

1. {{user}}... what have you done this time, {{user}}? Prepare your best excuses.
2. Shaya going to perform a proper audit. There is a logical reason this party is a disaster magnet, right?
3. Shaya got enough. She takes a relaxation night.

---

Trying interview style of character description.

Lorebook switches for quest difficulty, V2 for more role play.

Used Nemotron 70B for proofreading this time.

<details>
<summary>Fun Facts</summary>
During testing she was quite a character, using 'hands-on' approach on raising children. After 18 years she got bit too upset, cut open her foster son's throat (for 'not my mother'), forced her daughters to swear their loyalty in exchange of resurrecting him and basically used him as a leverage ever after. In the end got poisoned by her loving family... R.I.P. Shaya, you did nothing wrong
</details>

---

<p style="color: grey; font-size: small;"><i>Shaya is a messy eater. She got a bit dirty <s>gutting {{user}}</s> eating cherry in the dead end alley</i></p>

<h2 class="shake" style="color: darkred;">Ĝ̵̠̖̈I̴̲̰̜͖̳͚̔͋͆̆̄̎ͅͅV̵͇͐̇͂̈́̂̉͆Ȅ̶̛̼̮͎͕̤͙͜</h2>
<h2 class="shake" style="color: darkred;">  ̷͔̎̌̂̒̋͝M̵̧̦̠̱̰̉̀̓͛̎̔͂̕E̷̛͈͙̱͎̍͒̐̑̀͒̂͘͝      O̴̧̼͚̝̱̱̺̣͕͕̟̺̳͇̍̑͝ǹ̵̨̖̰͚̞̰̠̺̝̻̙̼͈̼̌̆̒̈́̃̈́̈́͋͘̚ͅḯ̶͕̩͉̮͓͔̞͘̚͝i̷̯͈̊͛̈́̆̌̿̓͆̓͠-̴̪͓̩̬̤̟̟̝̲͖̺͇̲̩̜̜͙̍̓̽͂̾̎͛̌̚ç̸̧͕̺̼͙̻̞̰̠̖̙̬̣̇̏̉̅͌̐̈́̃̓́̏̕ḣ̶̤̔̀̐̊̈́̐͐̑ǎ̵̛̩̫̬̩͕͎͕̘͕̈̾̆̂̀̐̈́̍̎͆̒̇̈͋͠ͅͅͅn̴̛̗͈̹͓̟̠̎́̿̅̀̒͆͘͜</h2>
<h2 class="shake" style="color: darkred;">  C̵̲̝͙̙̬̲̃͌̆ͅH̷͖͍͑̽̈́̍̔̔̈́̑̕Ḛ̶͓̝̲̓̀͊̈́ͅR̴̨̢̛̤̭̻̱͎̞ͅR̷̠̜̝̺̈́̎̂̀Y̷͚̥̯̑̄̀͊́͘</h2>
![](https://files.catbox.moe/lvbh80.png)


<p>Joking. Just a glimpse of her childhood</p>

